# Dotfiles repo: track portable Cursor config only.
# Machine-local data (extensions, chats, projects, etc.) stays on disk but is not committed.

*
!.gitignore

# User rules and skills
!rules/
!rules/**
!skills-cursor/
!skills-cursor/**
!skills/
!skills/**
!commands/
!commands/**

# CLI preferences
!cli-config.json

# Agent plan files
!plans/
!plans/**
